{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-seven-palm","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"seven-palm-seven-tides-palm-jumeirah","about":"Seven Palm is a complex with premium class apartments and a 5-star hotel, located on the artificial island Palm Jumeirah, next to the shopping center Nakheel and 100 m from the shore. It is two 14-storey towers connected by an upper floor, roof and glass galleries. The northern tower is occupied by a hotel, the southern tower is a residential building.The project features studios, 1- to 3-bedroom residential apartments, as well as hotel studio apartments and 1-bedroom apartments. Residences are sold with luxury finishes, complemented by panoramic windows overlooking the bay, marina, the famous Burj Al Arab Hotel and the skyscrapers of the Dubai Marina area.The apartments are sold fully furnished, bedrooms have walk-in closets, bathrooms have rain showers. Kitchens are equipped with appliances, counters and stove.On the roof of the building there is a swimming pool, terrace with lounge area, bars, restaurant. Residents and guests of the complex can use the equipped gym with changing rooms and showers free of charge. There are stores on the first floor.Opposite Seven Palm are Nakheel shopping center and Golden Mile shopping gallery. Asya's Nursery and Redwood Montessori are a 15-minute walk away, while Choueifat International Schools and Dubai College are a 5-10-minute drive away. Dubai International Airport is 32 km away and Al Maktoum Airport is 40 km away. Nakheel Mall Monorail Station is a 6-minute walk away.","price":2400000,"title":"Seven Palm","bitrix":{"id":504,"pf_id":"are.2.9528","source":null,"project_id":"Seven Palm","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Seven Palm","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Seven Tides","project_location":"Palm Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1200/images/20